+        whose unions are flattened, deduplicated, fused, and absorbed) of this
+        type hint wrapper.
+
+        This wrapper itself is returned unchanged if this wrapper already is in
+        canonical form.
+
+        Returns
+        -------
+        TypeHint
+            Canonical form of this type hint wrapper.
+
+        Examples
+        --------
+        .. code-block:: pycon
