+        Parameters
+        ----------
+        other : TypeHint
+            Other type hint wrapper to be joined with this wrapper.
+
+        Returns
+        -------
+        TypeHint
+            Join of this and that type hint wrapper.
+
+        Raises
+        ------
+        beartype.roar.BeartypeDoorException
+            If that object is *not* a type hint wrapper.
+        '''
