+        form if these wrappers are *not* disjoint *or* :data:`None` otherwise
+        (i.e., if these wrappers are disjoint).
+
+        Parameters
+        ----------
+        other : TypeHint
+            Other type hint wrapper to be met with this wrapper.
+
+        Returns
+        -------
+        Optional[TypeHint]
+            Either:
+
+            * If these wrappers are disjoint, :data:`None`.
+            * Else, the meet of this and that type hint wrapper.
+
+        Raises
+        ------
+        beartype.roar.BeartypeDoorException
+            If that object is *not* a type hint wrapper.
+
+        Examples
+        --------
+        .. code-block:: pycon
+
+           >>> from beartype.door import TypeHint
+           >>> from collections.abc import Sequence
+           >>> TypeHint(Sequence[int]).meet(TypeHint(list[object]))
+           TypeHint(list[int])
+        '''
+
+        # If the passed object is *NOT* a type hint wrapper, raise an exception.
+        die_unless_typehint(other)
